<title>JAPAN: Seven-Eleven Japan - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Seven-Eleven Japan - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenue	    128.52		vs	  117.41</p>
<p> Operating	   55.02		vs	   50.00</p>
<p> Current	     55.39		vs	   52.44</p>
<p> Net		   29.55		vs	   28.43</p>
<p> EPS		   70.97 yen	  vs	   75.09 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    416 million	  vs	 379 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 17.50 yen	  vs	   17.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Seven-Eleven Japan Co Ltd is a leading convenience chain store.</p>
</text>
